Hi Alberto,

On 27.02.2016 17:28, James Clarke wrote:
> There is an unstable suite on debian-ports.org
> <http://debian-ports.org> (/etc/apt/sources.list: deb
> http://ftp.debian-ports.org/debian unstable main). There are also a
> few packages in the unreleased suite (debian-ports as well), in case
> you find something is missing.

Right.
You can use the ISO image at=20
http://backup.parisc-linux.org/debian-cd/debian-8.0/alpha/
to initially install Debian 8.

After successful installation, you need to add the debian-ports
repository to your /etc/apt/sources.list file, so that you will receive
regularly new updates. Add those entries to /etc/apt/sources.list:
  deb http://ftp.debian-ports.org/debian/ unstable main
  deb http://ftp.debian-ports.org/debian/ unreleased main

Helge


